1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Open the Target Lab to deploy a vulnerable test environment

2
00:00:04,186 --> 00:00:07,186
The catalog shows Vulhub environments with CVE info and difficulty

3
00:00:07,198 --> 00:00:10,198
Click Deploy on an environment to create it in the cluster

4
00:00:09,313 --> 00:00:12,313
The target is being created — watch the status change

5
00:00:13,361 --> 00:00:16,361
Click Logs to watch the deployment progress

6
00:00:16,512 --> 00:00:19,512
Waiting for the target to become ready...

7
00:03:33,137 --> 00:03:36,137
Target is running — click Scan to start scanning it

8
00:03:33,171 --> 00:03:36,171
Click Start Scan to begin

9
00:03:33,177 --> 00:03:36,177
The scan shows real-time progress for each tool

10
00:04:18,222 --> 00:04:21,222
Nmap discovers open ports and running services

11
00:05:18,261 --> 00:05:21,261
Metasploit verifies exploitable vulnerabilities

12
00:13:36,768 --> 00:13:39,768
Scan complete — results are shown with findings per tool

13
00:13:39,283 --> 00:13:42,283
Enrichment adds CVSS scores and EPSS exploit probability data

14
00:13:42,422 --> 00:13:45,422
Click 'Reports' to view detailed findings
